{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_title", "source_sha256": "bce3efafb3a332e82c679238d3879acc63738772ed00d1682c982a45bcd1cf5f", "ja": "「UNION!!」SPコミュ", "zh": "“UNION!!”特别剧情", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b6212eb919191c53e47b02ae0e0738e5f13cc0ee366a89510168b2d2ce9607ba", "ja": "話題のビッグイベント『アイドルグランド\nフェスティバル Autumn』開幕間近！\n大舞台を前に、大切な人達の事を考える\nアイドルたちの一幕です。", "zh": "备受瞩目的盛大活动『偶像盛典 Autumn』即将开幕！在这场大舞台来临之前，偶像们心中惦念着重要之人的片刻故事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "66e5caa09ac294b9a7740c489585e1e4ef5a9a6927d79625f511fdc91f0225ee", "ja": "『アイドルグランドフェスティバル Autumn』…\nこの秋話題のビッグイベントに、みんなで出場だ！", "zh": "“偶像盛典 Autumn”……\n大家要一起参加这个今秋备受瞩目的大型活动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "02bf0e733ca9e971f12c9aeb88c2b4ee309c2f692452e31db3eadd8d2aba2aec", "ja": "うわー！　やっぱドームってテンション上がるよなー！\n{$P$}、ちょっと見て来ていい！？", "zh": "哇——！果然在巨蛋里就是让人兴奋啊——！\n{$P$}，我去稍微看看，可以吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "337fe2ace4e3ba0e54e2ae32d8e5dd1928037ff8b6558017991d01e28856600b", "ja": "落ち着いてください、昴さん。もうすぐ本番ですし、\nもう一度振り付けを確認しておいた方が……。", "zh": "请冷静一下，昴。马上就要正式演出了，还是再确认一遍舞蹈动作比较好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "7cbedd73289d510ca067bce3c17a5336e00bacc7e84f77b49dbba54f7364667f", "ja": "さすが、志保ちゃんは落ち着いてるねぇ。\nあたしも同い年だし、見習わないといけないべさ。", "zh": "不愧是志保，你还真沉得住气啊。\n我和你同岁，也得向你学习才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "73689b056ad349ebde89251e2fbcb539740ff4be719b90b96870f5b6131ca913", "ja": "本当ですね～。私は三つ上ですけど、\n見習いたいです～。", "zh": "确实呢～我虽然比她大三岁，但也想向她学习～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "c6f67ef5df87e323e657793bf2d65283f459559dd5b458c40fbf86cb23cd4cd7", "ja": "別にひなたはいいの。美也さんも、からかわないで\nください。私よりずっと落ち着いてるのに。", "zh": "日向的话就算了。美也小姐也请别取笑我，明明比我沉稳多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "d37a95d00773320c25ee46b98a338c84520e9b5bbf21c80a2f0c541e4c66e228", "ja": "あれっ、オレはダメなの？", "zh": "咦，难道我不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "0aec6ba620d4084055982b8621a2ad22fa1339852f3e1f0a5825dda23f4a8f9b", "ja": "でも、志保ちゃんがはりきっているのには\n理由があるのです。姫はなんでも知っているのですよ♪", "zh": "不过，志保这么起劲是有原因的。公主什么都知道哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "1f1b3efd0237374025c467005fe0f843f5aba2e278d60f27b0346b3eb50689e2", "ja": "ごめんね、実はさっき、たまたま見ちゃって。\n志保ちゃん、ご家族に電話してたでしょ？", "zh": "对不起，其实刚才我碰巧看到了。志保，你是在给家里人打电话吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "b8777ac929cbd1141d4ef03014868514063014747b9b95909ea7a64c40554ff9", "ja": "とっても嬉しそうに自慢していたのです。\n可愛かったのですよ♪", "zh": "一脸特别开心地炫耀着呢。\n真可爱哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "46d7967cb6b1831a0a02f2558f8e0fb3e7a0ea914bba284d09b17788b0e9f065", "ja": "そうなの？\nなーんだ、志保も浮かれてるってことだな！", "zh": "是这样吗？\n原来志保也兴奋得不得了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "2a0cdf57c1979549be1c2e19e97aa2141c6f968f4770c76ee7bebd236fe36d09", "ja": "べ、別に浮かれてません！　今日はお母さん……\n家族を招待してるから、ちょっと話しただけで。", "zh": "才、才没有得意忘形呢！今天是因为邀请了妈妈……\n家人过来，所以才稍微聊了几句。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "3478431e0e4fe10017f9eaa78e98d20accccfaa5a0acde4ed334a6515ab399e8", "ja": "大丈夫、私も家族を招待してるから仲間だよ♪\nこんな大きな会場、なかなか出られないもんね。", "zh": "没事的，我也邀请了家人，所以咱们彼此彼此啦♪\n毕竟这么大的场馆，平时可没什么机会登台呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b6d28ae54a957f60a01aac46d0715f5bc19de9973f797281e3c22a1d21b7d383", "ja": "ああ、せっかくの機会だ。\nみんなの大切な人達に、しっかり見てもらおうな！", "zh": "啊，难得有这样的机会。\n让大家重要的人好好看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "4142dc44254266701cf632259458ac3ed7123df69a18cbe1952d653ef79f19c6", "ja": "はいほー！　それでは{$P$}さんも、\nステージから目を離してはいけないのです。……ね？", "zh": "嗨哟！那么，{$P$}先生也不可以移开视线，要好好看着舞台哦……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b9a3438aeac377d261c2e486faa1af4d465bffa4f742a75211749f4371045439", "ja": "……うん？", "zh": "……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "7665d6f5f23998125bd54708a03bbfe591493ed44567f698c102dbc7137ca184", "ja": "えへへ、そうだねぇ。こんな立派なところまで、\nあたし達を連れてきてくれて……。", "zh": "诶嘿嘿，是啊。还带着我们来到这么气派的地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1018_042miy", "source_sha256": "018d8e86ceccb7246f4f1ff51cd91b714ae0c353c589e6fc11f8e90e8fcdc487", "ja": "いつも一緒に歩いて来てくれた、\nとっても大切な人ですからね～。むふふ♪", "zh": "因为一直陪我走过来，是对我来说非常重要的人呢～。唔呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "c4d44dc288211e7095f749eb121967a90e8e0ff27551a7685117752f6f678a24", "ja": "それに、これからもずーっと……。\n大切な人です！", "zh": "而且，从今往后也会一直……  \n是我最重要的人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1020_021mat", "source_sha256": "dd470f9b3643fa2a6f86a0864444b3e766dd04a04bfa6c3d6af3d45d7f5240cd", "ja": "今日のキラキラな舞踏会は\n姫たちみんなが主役なのです♪", "zh": "今天这场闪闪发光的舞会  \n公主们全都是主角哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "b2bbf00d82f0ebfe49cf779930d22b5e6c328d6ef09365072eb965c764033b9b", "ja": "そういえば……。へへっ、じゃあさ、今日はみんなで、\n{$P$}に見せつけてやろうぜ！", "zh": "说起来……嘿嘿，那今天我们就一起让{$P$}先生好好见识一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "338de8206f4cce75b74d2af9bb7c9e13e8bacb5705a28acb49a8e2bd8fe3a7a8", "ja": "そうですね。家族も大事ですけど……。\nふふっ、せっかくですから、一緒に。", "zh": "是啊。家人也很重要，不过……  \n呵呵，难得有这个机会，就一起吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1023_p", "source_sha256": "f8a94bc33a5d7d80867abae0b96ccef93899c46c608bc3096ece5ca71a9b42fe", "ja": "……。そうか、ありがとう。\nもちろん、思いっきり見せつけてくれていいぞ。", "zh": "……这样啊，谢谢。\n当然，尽管尽情向他们展现吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "a634dd5497a261e556e030cd1254c0f94127d3d4ecadfc5d83dce34f6ec21ee7", "ja": "何しろ客席は、みんなの一番大切な人達で\nいっぱいだからな！　いけるか？", "zh": "毕竟观众席上坐满的，都是大家最重要的人啊！能做到吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1025_021mat", "source_sha256": "69f9ea5cc3ff869f1d2f0c106765ed345d025e1628f2175304aa2f8aaf286207", "ja": "もちろんなのです！　姫たちは、その人たちに\n見てもらうために、ここにいるのです♪", "zh": "那是当然的！公主我们，就是为了让他们\n看到，才会站在这里的哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1026_042miy", "source_sha256": "c7e83d0fd1968444533d229f4ebe25dea36f10b25dc28a393eeaac62fd62acf7", "ja": "今日の会場はまんまるですから、どっちを向いても、\n目が合いますからね～♪", "zh": "因为今天的会场是圆形的，所以无论面向哪边，都会和大家对上视线哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_202_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_202_gc_01_1027_027say", "source_sha256": "d1c94396d389bf68c69c58f9c16b6695b29696c10b96d84cbc727c12b4620504", "ja": "思いっきり、届けてきますね。\n今の私たちを、しっかりと……。", "zh": "我会全力传达出去的。\n把现在的我们，确确实实地……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
